        "statement": "June 2026 - At 4788 feet the reservoir is full. With rainfall of 3 to 5 inches, combined with the remaining snowpack washing out which had 1 to 3 inches of estimated qpf, flooding occurred around Many Glacier in the trail system. The bridge was closed to Many Glacier Hotel. Flooding occurred around Swiftcurrent Motel and the open air theater. See SCLM8."
